  "statement_html": "On prépare une solution  de glucose en dissolvant\tune quantité de <i>n</i> mol de ce produit dans un volume d'eau\t<i>V</i>. Cela donne une solution de concentration <i>c</i><br>\tRemplissez le tableau. La concentration  <i>c</i> dans chaque case\tdoit correspondre à la quantité de matière <i>n</i> de sa colonne \tet au volume <i>V</i> de sa ligne.<p>\t <br>\t      <table class=\"wimsborder\"><tr><th style='background-color:#AAFFAA' colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">Concentration (mol/L)</th><th style='background-color:yellow;text-align:center' colspan=\"2\">Quantité de matière (mol)</th></tr><tr> <td style='background-color:yellow;padding:8'>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"7\"></span>    </td> <td bgcolor='yellow'>rint(10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.0312)))*0.0312)/10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.0312))) mol</td> </tr><tr> <th style='background-color:lightblue;vertical-align:medium' rowspan='3'>Volume de la solution<br>(L)</th> <td style='background-color:lightblue;padding:8'>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"7\"></span>    </td> <td style='background-color:#AAFFAA;padding:8'>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"7\"></span>    </td> <td style='background-color:#AAFFAA>'>rint(10**(2-1-floor(lg(1.0183)))*1.0183)/10**(2-1-floor(lg(1.0183))) mol/L</td> </tr><tr> <td style='background-color:lightblue;padding:8'>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"7\"></span>    </td> <td style='background-color:#AAFFAA;padding:8'>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"7\"></span>    </td> <td style='background-color:#AAFFAA>'>rint(10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.8898)))*0.8898)/10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.8898))) mol/L</td> </tr><tr> <td bgcolor='lightblue'>rint(10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.7729)))*0.7729)/10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.7729))) L</td> <td style='background-color:#AAFFAA>'>rint(10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.2179)))*0.2179)/10**(2-1-floor(lg(0.2179))) mol/L</td> <td style='background-color:#AAFFAA;padding:8'>\t  